{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10282060","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10282060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1028206001:0":{"text":"……あれ？お供えしてたフルーツが消えてる！ミサタ様がボクのお供えを受け取ってくれたんだ！","source_cn":"……咦？贡果不见了！弥萨忒收下我的祭品了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CC32294BB7C4621","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028206002:0":{"text":"ミサタ様、大地と川の神よ！お願いします！どうかボクの頼みを聞いてください！そして、その願いを叶えてください！","source_cn":"弥萨忒，大地与河川之神，赞美您！请您倾听我的请求，实现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8CC71BAC9C4FC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028206003:0":{"text":"ボクの名前はランディ、ジェイドレイク学園の生徒です……すでにご存じかとは思いますが。","source_cn":"我叫兰迪，是翡湖学院的学生……这您应该已经知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC7DBD42DF1F493","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028206004:0":{"text":"ボクの……ボクの学校生活は散々です。他のクラスメートと比べても、ボクはのろまで、これといった才能もありません……","source_cn":"我……我在学校过得不好。和同学比起来，我不太机灵，也没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2CADC5C16767221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028206005:0":{"text":"ミサタ様、どうかボクに力をお与えください！風の言葉が分かる能力でも、俊敏に動ける体でも構いません……ボクはその力を十分に発揮して、ヴェルディア連盟のために貢献することを約束します！","source_cn":"弥萨忒，请您赐给我天赋吧，风语的能力也好，灵巧的身体也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1790B7B053B291DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028206006:0":{"text":"ミサタ様、お供え……ああ！ロンロンが食べたのはやっぱり神様へのお供えだったんだ！！","source_cn":"弥萨忒，贡果……天啊，我们真的吃了贡品！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC6DB2F8E0C8940C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028206007:0":{"text":"そのうえあの子は、ミサタ様がお供えを受け取って、願いを叶えてくれると思ってるわ……","source_cn":"而且他觉得弥萨忒收下了贡品，会为他实现愿望……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CBCE5A9699ED4A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028206008:0":{"text":"ん？なんだが周囲に気配を感じる……","source_cn":"嗯？周围似乎有什么动静……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6C299430046066D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028206009:0":{"text":"もしかして……ミサタ様！あなたはボクの頼みを聞き入れ、ボクの五感を鋭くしてくれたのですか！？あなた様の恩恵に感謝します！","source_cn":"难道说……弥萨忒，您实现了我的愿望，让我的感官变得更加...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x706B3FB3FD5324F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028206010:0":{"text":"他にはどんな力をくださったのですか？風の声が聞こえる能力ですか？それとも強靭なパワーですか？","source_cn":"您赐予了我什么天赋？能倾听风的声音，或是强大的力量？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E9E73E117C46DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":""